WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.600
All right, let's get to an audience questions for&nbsp;
the week. First one increasingly relevant is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.880
vaccine rollout continues and vaccines are made&nbsp;
available, available to more and more Americans.&nbsp;

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.680
David, do you know people personally who&nbsp;
are refusing to get the coronavirus vaccine?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:23.280
You know, I do. And I don't really know conspiracy&nbsp;
theory types personally who are saying, oh, it'll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:28.400
alter your DNA or you're going to get microchips&nbsp;
by the vaccine. I know that a lot of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.040
believe that because I've seen the data, seen&nbsp;
the surveys, but I don't know any of those folks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:38.240
personally. What I'm seeing mostly in the people&nbsp;
I know who are saying they're not planning to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:44.000
vaccinated, or at least not for now, is lack of&nbsp;
information. They're just ignorant to the facts.&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.760
So, like, as one example, a friend of mine&nbsp;
a couple of weeks ago said, I'm not going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:56.160
to I'm not even going to think about getting a&nbsp;
vaccine until they do the Phase three trials.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:02.240
And I explained to him for the approved vaccines,&nbsp;
phase three trials have been done. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:08.160
the phase three trials have been done for months.&nbsp;
And we got that data in November, December, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:12.560
it was reviewed by the FDA and then an emergency&nbsp;
use authorization was put forward. And he said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:16.640
really? No, I didn't know. And I said, yeah, I&nbsp;
mean that you need the phase three data. There&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:24.160
was a discussion last summer about do we not do we&nbsp;
do an emergency use order before finishing phase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.840
three? If the data looks good, it wasn't done.&nbsp;
Phase three has been done. And once I explained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.000
that to him, he said, oh, well, I guess I'll look&nbsp;
into it now. What was really kind of scary is he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.560
works in the health care field. And we've we've&nbsp;
read about a number of a significant portion of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.080
nurses and others working in the health care field&nbsp;
who are saying, I'm not going to get the vaccine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:46.320
So that's some some folks that I'm hearing&nbsp;
from who say they're not going to get it. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:49.760
something like that. They don't think it's been&nbsp;
approved. They don't think phase three is done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:55.440
or whatever the case may be. But phase three is&nbsp;
done and there is an emergency use authorization.&nbsp;

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:00.720
The other people that I personally know who&nbsp;
are, you know, refusing is a weird term now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.600
because most of them aren't yet eligible.
But who are telling me they don't? A plan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:11.840
get a vaccine is that they're sort of saying it&nbsp;
as from a libertarian perspective, like they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:18.880
against forced vaccination. And I kind of point&nbsp;
out to them, if you're opting not to get it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:24.080
clearly you're not forced. And then this&nbsp;
gets into this weird discussion about,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:31.680
well, if in order to fly, you are required to&nbsp;
have it, you are being forced to get it. And I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:38.240
try to explain there's a difference between&nbsp;
mandatory and required for certain activities.&nbsp;

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:43.600
And I end up kind of coming back to the same&nbsp;
place from this libertarian perspective, which is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:50.480
as a libertarian, do you respect the right&nbsp;
of just hypothetically Delta Airlines to say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:56.960
we require people who want to fly with us to&nbsp;
present proof of vaccination after a certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:03.920
date and they end up usually in a pretzel of&nbsp;
some kind where they are uber libertarians who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:07.600
think businesses shouldn't be regulated, they&nbsp;
should be allowed to do whatever they want.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:12.560
And yet somehow they want to be able to decide&nbsp;
what Delta's policy should be. And if they want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:15.520
to fly without a vaccine, they should be allowed&nbsp;
to. You've got you've got to be a little more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:21.360
consistent here. And there is not going to be&nbsp;
a mandatory vaccination from the government.&nbsp;

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.880
There's no legal basis to do that. But that&nbsp;
being said, there are all sorts of different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.680
institutions that might say if you want to&nbsp;
choose to avail yourself of our product or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:37.360
service or to do business with us, one of our&nbsp;
requirements is that you be vaccinated. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:44.480
this is not legally problematic. This is not&nbsp;
constitutionally an issue, et cetera. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:49.680
in terms of the number of people remaining in the&nbsp;
U.S. who don't plan to get the vaccine, I don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:54.320
know whether to say we're in a good place or we're&nbsp;
not in a good place. There was a point months and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:59.040
months ago where more than half the country&nbsp;
said they did not plan to get a coronavirus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:03.360
vaccine. That number is down to about a third&nbsp;
of the country and it continues to go down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:09.680
It's good that the percentage of people who don't&nbsp;
plan to get it has basically dropped by half.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:17.280
The concerning part is that I don't know that&nbsp;
with two thirds of adult getting the vaccine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.880
two thirds of adults getting it and one third&nbsp;
not that we're going to reach herd immunity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:24.880
And that's really the concern at this point.&nbsp;
Dr. Fauci and others have said in particular,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:30.720
since we're not going to be vaccinating&nbsp;
kids in the immediate, we need close to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:37.040
all adults to get the vaccine, particularly with&nbsp;
these more transmissible variants, to really have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:42.080
herd immunity and protection.&nbsp;
So that there's good news here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:48.160
which is vaccine hesitancy is declining. The bad&nbsp;
news is there's still a lot of people, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:55.840
otherwise educated individuals, who think&nbsp;
everything from the vaccine will alter your DNA&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:03.280
to it'll allow the government to track you.
Oh, which reminds me, there is one acquaintance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:08.000
this is not a friend, but it's an acquaintance&nbsp;
who posted to Facebook not long ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:14.000
I have some reasonable concerns about the&nbsp;
vaccine. I'm not saying I'm not going to get it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:22.480
but I do believe this, that and that it could be&nbsp;
used to track my location. And a lot of our shared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.920
friends started trying to talk her off the ledge.&nbsp;
I just had to unfriend. It's just I can't do it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:32.480
guys. I can't do it. And I know many of you&nbsp;
have come up against the same situation.

